{"sha": "3b09da4b0fd1f3ecf8b22af19fe79a68dc2bd465150a657fb5aaca44da755a17", "body": ["\\begin{method}[证明或否定一致收敛]\\label{met:b2:funcseq:uniform}", "若 $f_n \\to f$ 在 $X$ 上逐点收敛：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 计算或估计 $\\norm{f_n - f}_\\infty$：研究", "        函数 $x \\mapsto \\abs{f_n(x) - f(x)}$（借助导数、单调性）", "        以求其最大值；一个对一切 $x$ 成立且", "        趋于 $0$ 的界即证明一致收敛。", "  \\item 要\\emph{否定}：给出点 $x_n$ 使得", "        $\\abs{f_n(x_n) - f(x_n)} \\not\\to 0$（常令 $x_n$ 跟随", "        移动的凸起，如\\cref{exo:b2:funcseq:1}所示）；或", "        用传递定理的逆否命题：", "        连续函数的不连续极限（见\\cref{ex:b2:funcseq:threshold}），", "        或在线段上 $\\int f_n", "        \\not\\to \\int f$。", "  \\item 对级数，先试正规收敛", "        （$\\sum\\sup\\abs{u_n} < \\infty$）；若整体失效，", "        则在有关的子线段上检验之", "        （见\\cref{ex:b2:funcseq:threemodes}）；若", "        处处失效，则一致收敛仍可能经由", "        交错余项估计", "        （见\\cref{exo:b2:funcseq:4}）或分部求和而成立。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{魏尔斯特拉斯逼近定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[魏尔斯特拉斯，经由伯恩斯坦]\\label{thm:b2:funcseq:weierstrass}", "每个连续的 $f \\colon \\intcc{0}{1} \\to \\R$ 都是", "多项式的一致极限——更确切地说，是其\\emph{伯恩斯坦", "多项式}\\index{伯恩斯坦多项式}\\index{魏尔斯特拉斯", "逼近定理}", "\\[", "B_n(f)(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} f\\Bigl(\\frac kn\\Bigr)\\binom nk x^k", "(1-x)^{n-k} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "取定 $x \\in \\intcc{0}{1}$，记 $p_k(x) = \\binom nk x^k(1 -", "x)^{n-k}$。三个二项恒等式，", "由 $(x + y)^n$ 及其两次关于 $x$ 的导数在 $y = 1 - x$ 处求值得到：", "\\[", "\\sum_k p_k = 1,", "\\qquad", "\\sum_k k\\,p_k = nx,", "\\qquad", "\\sum_k k(k-1) p_k = n(n-1)x^2 .", "\\]", "具体地，$(x+y)^n = \\sum_k\\binom nk x^ky^{n-k}$ 在 $y = 1-x$ 处", "即第一式；对 $x$ 求导，", "\\[", "n(x+y)^{n-1} = \\sum_k k\\binom nk x^{k-1}y^{n-k} ,", "\\]", "再乘以 $x$ 并令 $y = 1 - x$，即得", "第二式；两次求导并乘以 $x^2$，即得", "第三式。将 $(k - nx)^2 = k(k-1) + k(1 - 2nx) +", "n^2x^2$ 展开，并合并三式：", "\\[", "\\sum_k (k - nx)^2 p_k", "= n(n-1)x^2 + nx(1 - 2nx) + n^2x^2", "= nx(1 - x) \\leq \\frac n4 ,", "\\]", "即\\emph{方差恒等式}。", "", "下面估计，利用 $\\sum p_k = 1$：", "\\[", "\\abs{B_n(f)(x) - f(x)}", "\\leq \\sum_{k} \\Bigl| f\\Bigl(\\frac kn\\Bigr) - f(x)\\Bigr|\\, p_k(x)", "= \\Sigma_{\\text{近}} + \\Sigma_{\\text{远}} ,", "\\]", "按 $\\abs{\\frac kn - x} \\leq \\delta$ 成立与否进行拆分。", "给定 $\\varepsilon > 0$，由 $f$ 的一致连续性（海涅定理）可取", "$\\delta$ 使 $\\Sigma_{\\text{近}} \\leq \\varepsilon$。对远和，", "记 $M = \\norm f_\\infty$，由方差恒等式及", "切比雪夫的计数技巧，", "\\[", "\\Sigma_{\\text{远}} \\leq 2M \\sum_{\\abs{k - nx} > n\\delta} p_k", "\\leq 2M\\,\\frac{\\sum_k (k - nx)^2 p_k}{n^2\\delta^2}", "\\leq \\frac{2M}{4 n \\delta^2} \\cdot 1", "= \\frac{M}{2n\\delta^2}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{} 0 ,", "\\]", "对 $x$ 一致成立。于是 $\\norm{B_n(f) - f}_\\infty \\leq \\varepsilon +", "\\frac{M}{2n\\delta^2} \\leq 2\\varepsilon$（$n$ 充分大时）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "经仿射变换，定理对任一线段", "$\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上成立。在 $\\R$ 上不成立（多项式在", "$\\R$ 上的一致极限是多项式，见\\cref{exo:b2:funcseq:8}）。概率解释——", "$B_n(f)(x)$ 是 $f$ 在二项", "平均处的期望值，而方差界即切比雪夫不等式——", "这一点在\\cref{ch:b2:genfun}中予以严格说明。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=6.0cm,", "    xmin=0, xmax=1.05, ymin=0, ymax=1.08,", "    xtick={0,1}, ytick={1}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=0:1, samples=80] {x^2};", "  \\addplot[omDef!45, thick, domain=0:1, samples=2] {x};", "  \\addplot[omDef!70, thick, domain=0:1, samples=80]", "    {x^2 + x*(1-x)/2};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:1, samples=80]", "    {x^2 + x*(1-x)/6};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:0.30,0.37) {$B_1f$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:0.52,0.46) {$B_2f$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:0.76,0.56) {$B_6f$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:0.88,0.68) {$f$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}